      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/fYOcFkZtyQbM-_L8piMKdPoYHaXnj2lnp-Dr8glob1aale46dMDB7VYzOIw02zcREvgo0SYZ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "The journalistic depth of this script is outstanding. It is fascinating to learn that the \".tv\" domain (which powers massive platforms like Twitch) brings in about 1/12th of their entire national income just to keep the lights on and build seawalls [22:43]. The concept of Tuvalu literally backing up its entire sovereignty, maps, and heritage into the cloud to become the world's first digital nation [21:01] is one of the most profound and heartbreaking geopolitical strategies of our time. Exceptional research! 👏",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-31T15:04:26Z",
